  "_categoryComment": "Penguin has a species category; crab deliberately has none, because the only wiki categories whose names contain 'crab' are a quest and a cave that also hold a human and a snake.",
  "_ethnicityComment": "leagueRegion (where an NPC is found) is the default proxy for ethnicity (where they are from); a foreigner is corrected in tools/overrides.json. Regions absent here (No, General, N/A, ...) and any NPC documented across several regions carry no single ethnicity and keep the British default.",
  "leagueRegionEthnicity": {
